    <string id="str_wanderer_backstory_a.bamsi_the_brave" text="My kin thought me dead, and false pretenders sought to claim what was mine. When I returned, with twin blades in hand, I challenged the deceitful and reclaimed my honor." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_backstory_a.dundar_the_hawk" text="I can tell you the size of an enemy army three days before they arrive by the dust on the horizon and the flight of birds." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_backstory_a.turgut_the_hammer" text="I have swung this crescent axe against iron-studded fortress gates and shattered ranks of heavy cataphracts. A warrior learns the true measure of men when the stones fall." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_backstory_b.bamsi_the_brave" text="No fortress wall can cage a wolf of the steppes forever. In battle, I fight with a sword in each hand—one for vengeance, one for justice." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_backstory_b.dundar_the_hawk" text="My steppe steed knows my intent before I even touch the reins. From horseback, my arrows pierce mail with effortless precision." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_backstory_b.turgut_the_hammer" text="I served beside great beys, breaching castles where others feared to tread. Treachery took my brethren, but my axe remains steadfast." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_backstory_c.bamsi_the_brave" text="Now I wander these lands looking for a leader of true courage. Gold is nothing to me; brotherhood and renown are everything." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_backstory_c.dundar_the_hawk" text="Ambushers and scouts will never catch an army under my watch unawares. I bring the sight of a hawk to your banners." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_backstory_c.turgut_the_hammer" text="A shield wall is only as strong as its resolve. With this axe, I do not break lines—I obliterate them." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_backstory_d.bamsi_the_brave" text="Give me a blade and point to the vanguard of the enemy. You shall see my oath carved in steel." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_backstory_d.dundar_the_hawk" text="Give the order, and the steppes will reveal all their secrets to us." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_backstory_d.turgut_the_hammer" text="Lead me to the battlements, Commander. The gates will crumble before our advance." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_prebackstory.bamsi_the_brave" text="I am Bamsı of the steppes. For sixteen long years I languished in the fortress of Bayburt, bound in iron chains, until honor gave me the strength to break them." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_prebackstory.dundar_the_hawk" text="I am Dündar. The vast plains and whispering winds have been my teachers since I first pulled a bowstring." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_prebackstory.turgut_the_hammer" text="They call me Turgut. My homeland is wherever the battle lines clash and siege engines roar." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_response_1.bamsi_the_brave" text="A warrior of such spirit would be an invaluable asset to my company." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_response_1.dundar_the_hawk" text="A scout of your caliber will keep my army alive in hostile territory." />
    <string id="str_wanderer_response_1.turgut_the_hammer" text="I need a vanguard who knows how to breach gates and hold the line." />
